    },
    "source_fingerprint": "1ff54e4086242e17dbf7f51a248d63f33cc49bec1b126ce217b54220e3db1ec0",
    "source_id": "policy",
    "value": "Parent functional/presentation EUR; Subsidiary functional USD. Full-goodwill fair-value NCI election approved for this IFRS acquisition. Group adjustments only. Year-end goodwill CGU test consumes independently supplied valuation. Tax rate25% and zero uplift tax base are independently reviewed synthetic inputs, not law inferred from jurisdiction."
  },
